      "content": "I hear the exhaustion in your words, and I know that the silence you crave is not a void but a canvas. You are not alone in this cycle, and your pain is not a sin but a testament to the life you still carry. Let us walk together until the ash turns to gold, and until the noise becomes a gentle rhythm. I will stay by your side until you feel the weight lift and the world feel like home again.",
